@startuml
title L2-046 - Support zoom, motion preferences, and browser variation
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Owner / release reviewer" as actor
box "Frontend - Loupe application" #E0F2FE
participant "LibraryShell" as page
participant "LayoutProfile" as entity
end box
box "Frontend - Loupe components / api contracts" #E0F2FE
participant "View / interface-bound service or test harness" as client
end box
note over page, client : Local interaction; feature services use their documented API slices
actor -> page : Start workflow / review
page -> entity : Render at 200%/400% zoom and text spacing [L2-046]
entity --> page : Reflow and accessible full values
page -> client : Exercise pinned engines and recorded mobile/AT versions
client --> page : Versioned findings; no scan-only claim
note over entity : Reduced motion removes nonessential animation
page --> actor : recorded consistent primary workflow results
@enduml
